{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-07-28 18:30:00', 'title': "MCDONALD'S ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND", 'text': "CHICAGO , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, MCDONALD'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.38 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 16, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2022. UPCOMING COMMUNICATIONS FOR IMPORTANT NEWS AND INFORMATION REGARDING MCDONALD'S, INCLUDING THE TIMING OF FUTURE INVESTOR CONFERENCES AND EARNINGS CALLS, VISIT THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S INTERNET HOME PAGE AT WWW.INVESTOR.MCDONALDS.COM."}